  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 425964814336
    m_Localized: "This tape is on the wrong shelf.\n\n\u2022 Check the cover, title,
      and sticker to identify the tape\u2019s subgenre.\n\u2022 Find the matching
      subgenre label \u2014 it also has a sticker you can compare with the tape\u2019s.\n\u2022
      Place the tape on the corresponding shelf.\n\nYou can use any empty slot on
      the correct shelf. A glow and a sound will confirm correct placement. Sunset
      Creek tapes are the exception: their order matters.\n\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2686895996928
    m_Localized: TUTORIAL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1129744569155584
    m_Localized: HOW TO FIND THE RIGHT SHELF FOR A TAPE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1129744598515712
    m_Localized: "HOW TO IDENTIFY A TAPE\u2019S GENRE USING THE VCR"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1129744598515713
    m_Localized: "The VCR can help you narrow down your search for the right shelf.\n\n\u2022
      Insert the tape into the VCR.\r\n\u2022 Watch the clip and read the genre name
      that appears.\r\n\u2022 Find that genre\u2019s section, then use the tape\u2019s
      cover, title, and sticker to identify the right subgenre.\r\n\nThe VCR reveals
      only the genre. You\u2019ll still need to work out the subgenre and find the
      correct shelf yourself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1129744598515714
    m_Localized: HOW TO COLLECT TAPES RETURNED BY CUSTOMERS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1129744598515715
    m_Localized: "Customers call and return tapes as you make progress with sorting.\n\n\u2022
      When the phone rings, answer it and talk to the customer.\r\n\u2022 Keep sorting
      tapes.\r\n\u2022 When a returned tape arrives, collect it from the box by the
      door and find its correct shelf.\n\nNew events depend on how many tapes you\u2019ve
      sorted. Keep sorting to receive more calls, returned tapes, and gifts."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1129744598515716
    m_Localized: HOW TO DECORATE THE STORE WITH GIFTS FROM CUSTOMERS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1129744598515717
    m_Localized: "Sometimes, customers leave gifts to make the store feel cozier.\n\n\u2022
      Pick up the gift by the door.\r\n\u2022 Find its highlighted spot.\r\n\u2022
      Take the gift there and place it.\r\n\nEach gift has a designated spot. Once
      placed, it cannot be moved or removed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1129744598515718
    m_Localized: HOW TO CHANGE THE MUSIC IN THE STORE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1129744598515719
    m_Localized: "Audio cassettes let you choose the music while you sort.\n\n\u2022
      Select an audio cassette on the shelf above the cassette player.\r\n\u2022
      Press Play on the player to start the selected music.\r\n\nLook around the
      store for more audio cassettes. The ones you find will appear on the shelf
      above the cassette player."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1129744598515720
    m_Localized: HOW TO PUT SUNSET CREEK EPISODES IN ORDER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1129744598515721
    m_Localized: "Sunset Creek episodes must be arranged in story order.\n\n\u2022
      Watch the Sunset Creek tapes on the VCR.\r\n\u2022 Compare the events in each
      episode to work out their sequence.\r\n\u2022 Place each tape in its corresponding
      slot on the show\u2019s shelving unit.\r\n\nThese are the only tapes that require
      a specific slot. If you\u2019re unsure about the order, watch the episodes
      again on the VCR."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
